'''Joe Sweet''' (born July 5, 1948) is a former professional [[wide receiver]] for the [[Los Angeles Rams]]<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/S/SweeJo00.htm|title = Joe Sweet Stats|website = [[Pro-Football-Reference.com]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.pressenterprise.com/2016/01/26/rams-rosey-grier-other-ex-players-sound-off-on-nfls-return-to-la/|title = RAMS: Rosey Grier, other ex-players sound off on NFL's return to LA|date = 26 January 2016}}</ref>

Sweet attended [[Rochelle High School (Florida)|Rochelle High School]] in [[Lakeland, Florida|Lakeland]], [[Florida]]. In college he attended [[Tennessee State University]].
